# worker-anchor only. The anchorer key (MAINNET_ANCHORER): it signs the hourly receipt roots and announces the receipt
# signing key when it rotates. In memo mode (no anchor program) its signature is what makes a memo line a root, and its
# public half goes into ANCHORER_ADDRESS of .env.production; in program mode it is trellis_anchor's authority. A base58 64-byte ed25519 secret key. No other signing key may be in this file.
ANCHORER_PRIVATE_KEY=
